Architecture (target):

Browser UI  ->  FastAPI backend  ->  Gemini API
(HTML/JS)       (auth, prompts,       (generation,
                 key storage)          analysis)
     |
 localStorage vault (prototype) -> database (production)

Module design

Module	Responsibility
Builder	Form input, template selection, streaming output, editor
Vault	CRUD on saved documents, search, badge counter
Analyzer	Text input, rule/AI audit, score badge, findings list
SDLC Dashboard	Phase tracking cards
Utilities	Toasts, word count, export, print

Data model (vault record):
{ id, title, type, partyA, partyB, date, jurisdiction, term, riskScore, content }
 UI/UX design:

Palette: navy backgrounds with gold accent (legal/trust feel) and cyan for analysis.
Type: Cinzel for brand, Inter for UI, JetBrains Mono for data.
Layout: a 5/7 column split (form left, live document right) and four tabs.
Feedback: pulse status indicator, typing cursor, toast notifications.

Key flows:

Select template, fill form, Generate, edit, Save.
Vault, choose a document, Analyze, view report.
Paste text, Run audit, read findings and recommendation.

Prompt design (for real Gemini integration): a system prompt fixing role (drafting assistant), required sections, mandatory disclaimer, and tone, plus a user prompt filled from the form fields. The current tone field is collected but not yet used, so it belongs her
